The container image installs Debian packages and runs them as separate programs:

- ca-certificates
- openssl
- poppler-utils, used as pdftotext
- libreoffice-writer, only when the image is built with INSTALL_SOFFICE=1

Those packages keep the licenses and copyright files Debian ships with them. Their source is the corresponding Debian source package. The image does not relicense them.
